                    Dulles was going to Paris to attend
                    the NAC Ministerial meeting scheduled for Dec.
                    17–18; for documentation, see <ref target="frus1952-54v05p1#pg_549">pp.
                        549</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
